n of reconciliation, Kaori goes to Takeru's apartment. Takeru warmly encourages her while she smiles and does her best at cooking, something she's not good at. Then, Kaori, unable to hold back her emotions, throws her arms around him. Thinking that she put him off again, Kaori tries to leave, but Takeru pulls her back and kisses her.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/urqtngM3N9fmiZbQKqkKcku0lTu.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 3","synopsis":"As a sign of reconciliation, Kaori goes to Takeru's apartment. Takeru warmly encourages her while she smiles and does her best at cooking, something she's not good at. Then, Kaori, unable to hold back her emotions, throws her arms around him. Thinking that she put him off again, Kaori tries to leave, but Takeru pulls her back and kisses her.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/urqtngM3N9fmiZbQKqkKcku0lTu.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 4","titleKey":"Episode {{number}}","titleParams":{"number":"4"},"episodeNumber":4,"sourceEpisodeNumber":4,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"20040","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"211877","episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"mal","id":"64131","episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"336654","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"477658","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[4]}],"link":"110876","synopsis":"Takeru jolts awake as the flashbacks of his encounter with Tomoko, which seemed to erase his promise to Kaori, flood his mind. When he sits up, his gaze falls on Tomoko, with whom he spent the night, as she prepares breakfast with practiced ease.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/bX0fgeGjzBGnzBlbZeYZzqZyJ4V.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 4","synopsis":"Takeru jolts awake as the flashbacks of his encounter with Tomoko, which seemed to erase his promise to Kaori, fl